# Adversarial review

Before merging anything into `master`, run the adversarial multimodel review and do not merge until blocking findings are fixed or the user explicitly accepts them.

Read and follow the `adversarial-multimodel-review` skill. The implementing agent's own summary is not that review.

On `dev` and on `feature/*` or `bugfix/*` branches, run the review only when the user asks.

A tagged release is still a merge onto `master`, so the review is required there too.
